<main><section class="page-hero legal-hero"><div class="site-container"><p class="section-kicker">LEGAL INFORMATION FOR PROS</p><span class="draft-badge">Draft — not yet in force</span><h1>Pro agreement.</h1><p>Version {{ config('sortd.legal.pro_agreement_version') }}. This is an outline for test sign-ups. A full, lawyer-reviewed agreement will replace it before live jobs are offered.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="site-container legal-grid"><nav class="legal-toc" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#joining">Joining Sortd</a><a href="#jobs">Jobs and quotes</a><a href="#standards">Professional standards</a><a href="#customer">Customer information</a><a href="#money">Money and disputes</a><a href="#draft">Draft status</a></nav><article class="legal-content"><section id="joining"><h2>Joining Sortd</h2><p>Pros apply to join and provide information about their business, trade, service areas and qualifications. Sortd reviews identity, relevant registrations and references before a pro can receive work. Joining is free.</p></section><section id="jobs"><h2>Jobs and quotes</h2><p>Pros choose whether to quote for an available job and set their own prices. Quotes should clearly separate labour, materials and any call-out charges and describe the work they cover.</p></section><section id="standards"><h2>Professional standards</h2><p>Pros are expected to provide accurate information, work within their qualifications and follow applicable safety and trade requirements. The final agreement will set out detailed performance and conduct standards.</p></section><section id="customer"><h2>Customer information</h2><p>Before a quote is accepted, pros receive only the job details needed to quote, including the suburb. Customer contact details and street address are shared with the selected pro only after acceptance and should be used for that job.</p></section><section id="money"><h2>Money and disputes</h2><p>Commission, payment timing, refunds, cancellations and dispute rules are still being finalised. The private test site does not process real payments or offer real jobs.</p></section><section id="draft"><h2>Draft status</h2><p>This outline is not the final live pro agreement. Review the finished agreement before taking on real work. See the <a wire:navigate.hover href="{{ route('terms') }}">Terms of service</a> and <a wire:navigate.hover href="{{ route('privacy') }}">Privacy notice</a>.</p></section></article></div></section></main>@include('pages.partials.footer')</div></x-layouts.app>
